OL,3,GNEWSAHeathrow and Gatwick among
OL,4,Aairports hit by air traffic control
OL,5,Aproblems
OL,6,
OL,7,FBritish Airways has already cancelled a
OL,8,Fnumber short-haul services. The airline
OL,9,Fis prioritising long-haul departures.
